  "description": "BLACK+DECKER Box Fan with 3 Speed Settings, 20” Box Fan... - Distributed/Packaged by Black+Decker. Product Details: BLACK+DECKER Box Fan with 3 Speed Settings, 20” Box Fan... - Distributed/Packaged by Black+Decker. Product Details: BLACK+DECKER Box Fan with 3 Speed Settings, 20” Box Fan with Carrying Handle, Rotary Knob and Recessed Cord Storage, Portable Fan and Cooling Fan for Home, Office, Garage, Basement & More | Powerful 80W Motor, 5-Blade Portable Fan with Carry Handle, Rotary Knob, Cooling for Home, Office, Garage, Basement & More - Distributed/Packaged by Black+Decker. Product Details: If you need a reliable, ongoing cool breeze day or night, this BLACK+DECKER™ 20-In. Box Fan is your answer. With compact dimensions of 20.67 in. x 4.13 in. x 21.06 in. and a weight of only 7.05 lbs., you can transport this portable fan seamlessly thanks to its accessible carrying handle. Choose from 3 speeds on your rotary fan dial - low, medium, or high. This fan with handle is one of the finest portable fans, as it includes a high-quality copper motor and rain-resistant motor housing. With a cord length of 6 ft. as well as recessed cord storage, you can use this 20-in. box fan anywhere you need it most. Place on your office table and enjoy a delightful breeze during the workday. Use our 3-speed fan on the garage floor, in hallways, attics, basements, and underneath desks. You can even utilize it as a window fan! Simply turn the fan around to allow exhaust applications to help remove musky odors and circulate air. To ensure optimally safe functionality, our BLACK+DECKER™ 20-in box fan is made of polypropylene and includes stabilizing plastic feet to keep it securely in place. With its compact dimensions and variety of speeds, you'll want this 20 in. box fan to be a staple of your day-to-day life.",
